; ions.mdp — Preprocessing for genion (Aβ39)
; ============================================
; System: Aβ39 monomer (39 residues: Asp1–Val39)
; Force field: CHARMM36m / CHARMM-modified TIP3P
;
; NOTE ON Aβ39 STRUCTURE:
; Aβ39 lacks the C-terminal tripeptide Val40-Ile41-Ala42 that is
; present in the more amyloidogenic Aβ42 variant. No high-resolution
; NMR structure of monomeric Aβ39 is available in the PDB.
;
; RECOMMENDED STARTING STRUCTURE PREPARATION:
; Option A (preferred): Truncate PDB 1IYT (Aβ42) by deleting residues
;   40–42 using a text editor, then add proper C-terminal capping:
;   gmx pdb2gmx will automatically add -COO⁻ terminus to Val39.
; Option B: Use the Aβ40 structure PDB 2LFM (residues 1–40) and
;   truncate residue 40. This is solved in aqueous SDS micelles.
; Option C: Build from sequence using a coil-generation tool (e.g.,
;   Modeller or PyMOL's "fab" command) — appropriate for IDPs since
;   the initial structure will be lost during equilibration anyway.

integrator      = steep
emtol           = 1000.0
emstep          = 0.01
nsteps          = 10000

nstlist         = 1
cutoff-scheme   = Verlet
verlet-buffer-tolerance = 0.005
coulombtype     = cutoff
rcoulomb        = 1.0
rvdw            = 1.0
pbc             = xyz
